  <scopecontent id="85fe1fca921e354f7b79abf0387df2e0">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>Reports, studies, papers, program and planning files and correspondence from the Population Council office in Morocco.</p>  </scopecontent>
  <userestrict id="17cb5bc52016193414aba669b3cb4c4e">
    <head>Conditions Governing Use</head>
<p>Collection is open for research. If accessing the records of the Population Council, I understand that I am given access to these records on condition that I will not identify by name, either in my research notes or in publication or recording, the names of individuals who received or apparently received medical diagnoses and/or treatments, whose case(s), may be documented or mentioned by personal name in the Population Council records.</p>  </userestrict>
  <accessrestrict id="4a6682bd9fe42cd109fea52eb50a0cc3">
    <head>Conditions Governing Access</head>
<p>Open for research. Brittle or damaged items are available at the discretion of the RAC.</p>  </accessrestrict>
